00:04:20.020 --> 00:04:25.160
This is the exact scenario where our earlier rule about volume confirmation would have helped

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:31.700
avoid the ACM loss 16 days ago. We will track the position through next week and evaluate results

00:04:31.700 --> 00:04:38.700
on Friday. Remember this remains a learning exercise only. Now let us review yesterday's flash trade.

