The last flash trade was SN Snow on a momentum entry after a raised revenue forecast plus

00:04:45.240 --> 00:04:55.040
major AWS partnership. Entry came at $237 at market open and exit at $239.20 at market close.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:03.220
The position gained 0.93% are $9.28 on a $1,000 simulated stake.

